                    {
                        "sense_id": "13e072ab-cc54-3326-bf73-b66857911583",
                        "entry_id": "7daa9723-942b-3b36-a064-66cffbc839c7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "sponge cake"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "05ffa344-44f6-4e06-ad17-a528f63c59ec",
                                "sense_id": "13e072ab-cc54-3326-bf73-b66857911583",
                                "text": "Са́нин принуждён был вы́пить две больши́е ча́шки превосхо́дного шокола́да и съесть замеча́тельное коли́чество бискви́тов: он то́лько что прогло́тит оди́н, а Дже́мма уже́ подно́сит ему́ друго́й — и отказа́ться нет возмо́жности!",
                                "translation": "Sanin was compelled to drink two large cups of excellent chocolate, and to eat a considerable number of biscuits; no sooner had he swallowed one than Gemma offered him another—and to refuse was impossible!",
                                "english": "Sanin was compelled to drink two large cups of excellent chocolate, and to eat a considerable number of biscuits; no sooner had he swallowed one than Gemma offered him another—and to refuse was impossible!"
                            }
                        ]
